                                "sense_id": "fdc01ddd-09ec-31f9-aed6-ae0b51c589f4",
                                "text": "Fortunately, as I spoke my native language, Mr. Kirwin alone understood me; but my gestures and bitter cries were sufficient to affright the other witnesses.",
